<title>POLAND: BRE JULY NET RISES TO PLN 13. [CORRECTED]</title>
<headline>BRE JULY NET RISES TO PLN 13. [CORRECTED]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit				     13.79 vs   12.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				 16.99 vs   21.27</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations	     34.39 vs   34.42</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues    65.13 vs   44.55</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY				    1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit				     82.13 vs   80.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				107.00 vs  121.46</p>
<p>(corrects pre-tax profit to 107.00 mil zlotys from 654.73 mil zlotys)</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations	    211.40 vs  191.50</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues   401.22 vs  271.37</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
